{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:fb5a14e3938c63ab","name":"The Trade Federation","source":{"id":"source:reference-fb5a14e3938c63ab","title":"The Trade Federation","revision":24580,"timestamp":"2024-11-03T20:55:53Z","sha256":"c1db81d978dfae22ecfa041945628d215e6d2a235448a855bdec7e03478a78e4","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=24580","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=The%20Trade%20Federation&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-fb5a14e3938c63ab","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Clone Wars Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Clone_Wars_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The Trade Federation, under the leadership of Viceroy ",{"tag":"a","children":["Nute Gunray"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Nute_Gunray"},", feels cheated by the backlash over its occupation of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Naboo"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Naboo","referenceId":"reference:8c2767dbc8d173d5"},"- which was, technically speaking, perfectly legal- and they are awaiting an opportunity to recoup some of their considerable losses from the reparations they were forced to pay to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Naboo"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Naboo","referenceId":"reference:8c2767dbc8d173d5"}," and the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Gungans"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Gungans"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The Trade Federation creates its Droid Army initially for security purposes, but quickly puts it to use invading and occupying ",{"tag":"a","children":["Naboo"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Naboo","referenceId":"reference:8c2767dbc8d173d5"},". Although they are ordered to disarm after their defeat by the combined ",{"tag":"a","children":["Naboo"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Naboo","referenceId":"reference:8c2767dbc8d173d5"},"-",{"tag":"a","children":["Gungan"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Gungan","referenceId":"reference:f835c102d9e50780"}," forces, The Trade Federation merely transfers most of its materiel to subsidiary corporations- only to transfer it back, years later, in time to pledge its ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"}," forces to ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Confederacy of Independent Systems"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Confederacy_of_Independent_Systems","referenceId":"reference:dfc46c9d666b9b41"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Command Structure"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["The command structure of the Trade Federation's Droid Army is profoundly simple: Battle Droids report to Droid Officers, and Droid Officers report to their organic commanders.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"ul","children":[{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["AAT Crew (4 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droids","referenceId":"reference:6e72e583603b9ea8"},"):"]}," An ",{"tag":"a","children":["AAT"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/AAT"}," crew consists of 4 ",{"tag":"a","children":["OOM-Series Battle Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/OOM-Series_Battle_Droids"},"."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["MTT Crew (4 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droids","referenceId":"reference:6e72e583603b9ea8"},"):"]}," An ",{"tag":"a","children":["MTT"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/MTT","referenceId":"reference:202097e45d1db6d7"}," crew consists of 4 ",{"tag":"a","children":["OOM-Series Battle Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/OOM-Series_Battle_Droids"},"."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Troop Carrier Crew (2 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droids","referenceId":"reference:6e72e583603b9ea8"},"):"]}," A ",{"tag":"a","children":["PAC"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/PAC","referenceId":"reference:03d9f9382a2fbdcf"}," crew consists of 2 ",{"tag":"a","children":["OOM-Series Battle Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/OOM-Series_Battle_Droids"},"."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Squad (8 Battle Droids):"]}," A Squad consists of eight Battle Droids. Because the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droids","referenceId":"reference:6e72e583603b9ea8"}," are controlled by a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Remote Processor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Remote_Processor","referenceId":"reference:d46ac6dda5384866"},", no Squad Leader is required."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Platoon (56 Battle Droids):"]}," A Platoon consists of 7 Squads."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Company (112 Battle Droids plus support ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droids","referenceId":"reference:6e72e583603b9ea8"},"):"]}," A Company consists of 2 Platoons transported on either an ",{"tag":"a","children":["MTT"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/MTT","referenceId":"reference:202097e45d1db6d7"}," or a ",{"tag":"a","children":["PAC"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/PAC","referenceId":"reference:03d9f9382a2fbdcf"},", under the direct command of a Battle Droid Officer."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Battalion (784 Battle Droids plus support ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droids","referenceId":"reference:6e72e583603b9ea8"},"):"]}," A Battalion consists of 7 Companies and a reinforced Squadron of 24 ",{"tag":"a","children":["AATs"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/AATs"},", under the direct command of a Battle Droid Officer."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Vanguard (1,232 Battle Droids plus support ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droids","referenceId":"reference:6e72e583603b9ea8"},"):"]}," Intended for breaking through heavy defenses to deploy Battle Droids, a vanguard consists of 11 ",{"tag":"a","children":["MTT"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/MTT","referenceId":"reference:202097e45d1db6d7"}," companies and a squadron of 18 ",{"tag":"a","children":["AATs"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/AATs"},", under the direct command of a Battle Droid Officer."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Regiment (4,368 Battle Droids plus support ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droids","referenceId":"reference:6e72e583603b9ea8"},"):"]}," A Regiment consists of 4 Battalions and 1 Vanguard, under the direct command of a Battle Droid Officer. A Regiment is the total force carried aboard a ",{"tag":"a","children":["C-9979 Landing Craft"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/C-9979_Landing_Craft","referenceId":"reference:b64e9ac77467431c"},"."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Division (21,840 Battle Droids plus support ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droids","referenceId":"reference:6e72e583603b9ea8"},"):"]}," A Division consists of a 5 Regiments carried aboard a Section of 5 ",{"tag":"a","children":["C-9979 Landing Crafts"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/C-9979_Landing_Crafts"},"."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Corps (109,200 Battle Droids plus support ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droids","referenceId":"reference:6e72e583603b9ea8"},"):"]}," A Corps consists of a 5 Divisions carried aboard a Squadron of 25 ",{"tag":"a","children":["C-9979 Landing Crafts"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/C-9979_Landing_Crafts"},"."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Army (218,400 Battle Droids plus support ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droids","referenceId":"reference:6e72e583603b9ea8"}